key down
key down
sleep 300
shot shots/02-sequencer.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 500
shot shots/03-confirm.png
key n
sleep 400
shot shots/04-close.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/05-closed.png
quit
